				<property name='Callback' target='mCallback' typeid='24' hidden='1' locked='0' info='Optional callback which regularly provides device orientation information.

Euler angles showing current x-, y- and z-axis rotation are provided as separate parameters.' filter='Nam%cCallback
DesCalled regularly to provide device orientation
ParAlpha|FLOAT|The rotation around the z-axis, i.e. twisted anticlockwise around the centre of the screen (in degrees between 0 and 360)
ParBeta|FLOAT|The rotation around the x-axis, i.e. tilted forwards/backwards (in degrees between -180 and 180)
ParGamma|FLOAT|The rotation around the y-axis, i.e. tilted left/right (in degrees between -90 and 90)
ParAbsolute|BOOL|True if the device is providing data in reference to Earth&apos;s coordinate frame' />
			</properties>
